  unitName: Rage Beast Zegar
  unitId: 10022
  unitNumber: 26
  description: A boy found in a huge jungle in the territory of the devastated Agni
    Empire. After being taken in by the Agni Empire, from within himself awoke the
    ability to control beasts. Also, his unique claws grew in power and became strong
    enough to rip through armor. There are many rumors as to why he followed the
    Agni Empire, but the truth is unknown.
  summonDesc: Me, Zegar.<br>You need me claws?<br>We friend.
  fusionDesc: Roar! Roar!<br>Power get hot!<br>I get strong!
  evoDesc: My body hot!<br>I feel power here!
